              ),
              Expanded(flex: 100 - pct, child: const SizedBox()),
            ],
          ),
        ),
        Positioned.fill(
          child: Padding(
            padding: const EdgeInsets.only(right: 14),
            child: Align(
              alignment: Alignment.centerRight,
